                                                "sense_id": "86e32df7-311d-338d-af4a-0c036d5ce430",
                                                "text": "Ex world’s champion [Georges] Carpentier was also expert at kick-boxing."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f9793370-aae3-4026-b274-30ebf980a2d7",
                                                "sense_id": "86e32df7-311d-338d-af4a-0c036d5ce430",
                                                "text": "The Japanese kickboxing gym, recently opened in the Thai capital, had been a great success"
